jsonld.description:
LUNA, a cutting-edge PN (Polynucleotide) skin booster, stands out as a remarkable solution specifically designed for the delicate under-eye area. This innovative product combines the benefits of hyaluronic acid with PN, enhancing cell permeability and promoting a gradual release of HA gel. The slow release extends the active time of PN, thereby prolonging the overall efficacy of the product.
&amp;nbsp;
LUNA's unique formulation creates a dual impact by fostering both regeneration and brightening effects. Notably, ILLUMA LUNA sets itself apart with an impressive five times more PN (10mg of polynucleotide) than its counterparts in the market, supplemented by 5mg of Hyaluronic acid. The use of pharmaceutical-grade raw materials ensures the product's safety, particularly for the sensitive skin around the eyes. The outstanding effects of LUNA encompass the improvement of under-eye wrinkles, a brightening effect targeting dark circles, and the enhancement of skin moisture and pigmentation.
&amp;nbsp;
This comprehensive approach establishes LUNA as a superior skincare solution for the discerning individual seeking optimal results in under-eye rejuvenation.
